# Per-module versions for the pgedge CLI.
#
# Each module reports its own version (`pgedge version`), independent of
# the launcher and of the other modules. The launcher's version is the
# release git tag (see the Makefile / .goreleaser.yaml); the values here
# are the module versions injected into internal/<module>.Version.
#
# Bump a module's line when that module changes. Modules move on their
# own cadence to track each upstream service.
#
# To ADD a module:
#   1. add a <NAME>_VERSION line here (NAME = upper-cased module name),
#   2. add its module to internal/clitest/tree.go Modules() and
#      register it in cmd/pgedge/main.go,
#   3. add an ldflags entry in the Makefile and .goreleaser.yaml.
# TestModulesHaveVersionEntry fails the build if step 1 is missed.
#
# This file is intentionally KEY=VALUE with no spaces so it is valid as
# both a `make include` and a shell-sourced env file.
STARFLEET_VERSION=0.5.0
CONTROLPLANE_VERSION=0.5.0
